#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid "How to create a parallel transpilation program and deploy it to IBM Quantum Platform to use as a reusable remote service."
msgstr "Paano gumawa ng parallel transpilation na programa at i-deploy ito sa IBM Quantum Platform para gamitin bilang reusable remote service."

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Write your first Qiskit Serverless program"
msgstr "Isulat ang iyong unang Qiskit Serverless na programa"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<OpenInLabBanner notebookPath=\"guides/serverless-first-program.ipynb\" />\n"
msgstr "<OpenInLabBanner notebookPath=\"guides/serverless-first-program.ipynb\" />\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "{/* cspell:ignore mypath  */}\n"
msgstr "{/* cspell:ignore mypath  */}\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Accordion>\n"
"<AccordionItem title=\"Package versions\">\n"
msgstr ""
"<Accordion>\n"
"<AccordionItem title=\"Package versions\">\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The code on this page was developed using the following requirements.\n"
"We recommend using these versions or newer.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ang code sa page na ito ay ginawa gamit ang mga sumusunod na requirements.\n"
"Inirerekomenda naming gamitin ang mga bersyong ito o mas bago.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"</AccordionItem>\n"
"</Accordion>\n"
"<Admonition type=\"tip\">\n"
"**Qiskit Serverless is getting an upgrade, and its features are changing fast.** During this development phase, find release notes and the most recent documentation at the [Qiskit Serverless GitHub](https://qiskit.github.io/qiskit-serverless/index.html) page.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"</AccordionItem>\n"
"</Accordion>\n"
"<Admonition type=\"tip\">\n"
"**Ang Qiskit Serverless ay nagpapabuti, at mabilis nagbabago ang mga feature nito.** Sa panahon ng development phase na ito, hanapin ang mga release note at pinakabagong dokumentasyon sa pahina ng [Qiskit Serverless GitHub](https://qiskit.github.io/qiskit-serverless/index.html).\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "This example demonstrates how to use `qiskit-serverless` tools to create a parallel transpilation program, and then implement `qiskit-ibm-catalog` to upload your program to IBM Quantum Platform to use as a reusable remote service.\n"
msgstr "Ang halimbawang ito ay nagpapakita kung paano gamitin ang mga tool ng `qiskit-serverless` para gumawa ng parallel transpilation na programa, at pagkatapos ay gamitin ang `qiskit-ibm-catalog` para i-upload ang iyong programa sa IBM Quantum Platform bilang reusable remote service.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Workflow overview {#workflow-overview}"
msgstr "Pangkalahatang-ideya ng workflow {#workflow-overview}"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Create a local directory and empty program file (`./source_files/transpile_remote.py`)\n"
msgstr "Gumawa ng lokal na direktoryo at walang laman na program file (`./source_files/transpile_remote.py`)\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Add code to your program that, when uploaded to Qiskit Serverless, will transpile a circuit\n"
msgstr "Magdagdag ng code sa iyong programa na, kapag na-upload sa Qiskit Serverless, ay nagta-transpile ng circuit\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Use `qiskit-ibm-catalog` to authenticate to Qiskit Serverless\n"
msgstr "Gamitin ang `qiskit-ibm-catalog` para mag-authenticate sa Qiskit Serverless\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Upload the program to Qiskit Serverless\n"
msgstr "I-upload ang programa sa Qiskit Serverless\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "After uploading your program , you can run it to transpile the circuit by following the [Run your first Qiskit Serverless workload remotely](/guides/serverless-run-first-workload) guide.\n"
msgstr "Pagkatapos ma-upload ang iyong programa, maaari mo itong patakbuhin para ma-transpile ang circuit sa pamamagitan ng pagsunod sa gabay na [Patakbuhin ang iyong unang Qiskit Serverless workload nang remote](/guides/serverless-run-first-workload).\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Example: Remote transpilation with Qiskit Serverless {#example-remote-transpilation-with-qiskit-serverless}"
msgstr "Halimbawa: Remote transpilation gamit ang Qiskit Serverless {#example-remote-transpilation-with-qiskit-serverless}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "This example walks you through creating and adding to a program file that, when you upload it to Qiskit Serverless, will transpile a `circuit` against a given `backend` and target `optimization_level`.\n"
msgstr "Ang halimbawang ito ay ginagabayan ka sa paglikha at pagdaragdag sa isang program file na, kapag na-upload mo sa Qiskit Serverless, ay nagta-transpile ng `circuit` laban sa isang ibinigay na `backend` at target na `optimization_level`.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<DoqAdmonition type=\"tip\">\n"
msgstr "<DoqAdmonition type=\"tip\">\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Qiskit Serverless requires setting up your workload’s `.py` files into a dedicated directory. The following structure is an example of good practice:\n"
msgstr "Kailangan ng Qiskit Serverless na i-set up ang mga `.py` file ng iyong workload sa isang dedicated na direktoryo. Ang sumusunod na istruktura ay halimbawa ng magandang gawi:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "</DoqAdmonition>\n"
msgstr "</DoqAdmonition>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Serverless uploads the contents of a specific directory (in this example, the `source_files` directory) to run remotely. After these are set up, you can adjust `transpile_remote.py` to fetch inputs and return outputs.\n"
msgstr "Ina-upload ng Serverless ang mga nilalaman ng isang partikular na direktoryo (sa halimbawang ito, ang `source_files` na direktoryo) para patakbuhin nang remote. Pagkatapos ma-set up ang mga ito, maaari mong baguhin ang `transpile_remote.py` para kumuha ng mga input at magbalik ng mga output.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Create the directory and an empty program file {#create-the-directory-and-an-empty-program-file}"
msgstr "Gumawa ng direktoryo at walang laman na program file {#create-the-directory-and-an-empty-program-file}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "First, create a directory named `source_files`, then create a program file in the directory, so that its path is `./source_files/transpile_remote.py`. This is the file you will upload to Qiskit Serverless.\n"
msgstr "Una, gumawa ng direktoryo na pinangalanang `source_files`, pagkatapos ay gumawa ng program file sa direktoryo, upang ang path nito ay `./source_files/transpile_remote.py`. Ito ang file na ia-upload mo sa Qiskit Serverless.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Add code to your program file {#add-code-to-your-program-file}"
msgstr "Magdagdag ng code sa iyong program file {#add-code-to-your-program-file}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Populate your program file with the following code, then save it.\n"
msgstr "Punan ang iyong program file ng sumusunod na code, pagkatapos i-save ito.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"caution\">\n"
"If you're reading the code cells locally in a notebook, you will see the `%%writefile` [magic command](https://ipython.readthedocs.io/en/stable/interactive/magics.html#cellmagic-writefile). Executing cells with this magic command saves them to disk rather than executing them.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"caution\">\n"
"Kung binabasa mo ang mga code cell nang lokal sa notebook, makikita mo ang `%%writefile` [magic command](https://ipython.readthedocs.io/en/stable/interactive/magics.html#cellmagic-writefile). Ang pagpapatupad ng mga cell na may magic command na ito ay nagse-save ng mga ito sa disk sa halip na i-execute ang mga ito.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Add code to get program arguments {#add-code-to-get-program-arguments}"
msgstr "Magdagdag ng code para makuha ang mga argumento ng programa {#add-code-to-get-program-arguments}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Now add the following code to your program file, which sets up program arguments.\n"
msgstr "Ngayon, idagdag ang sumusunod na code sa iyong program file, na nagtatakda ng mga argumento ng programa.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Your initial `transpile_remote.py` has three inputs: `circuits`, `backend_name`, and `optimization_level`. Serverless is currently limited to only accept serializable inputs and outputs. For this reason, you cannot pass in `backend` directly, so use `backend_name` as a string instead.\n"
msgstr "Ang iyong paunang `transpile_remote.py` ay may tatlong input: `circuits`, `backend_name`, at `optimization_level`. Limitado pa lang ang Serverless na tumatanggap lamang ng serializable na mga input at output. Dahil dito, hindi mo maaaring direktang ipasa ang `backend`, kaya gamitin ang `backend_name` bilang string sa halip.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Add code that calls the backend {#add-code-that-calls-the-backend}"
msgstr "Magdagdag ng code na tumatawag sa backend {#add-code-that-calls-the-backend}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Add the following code to your program file, which calls your backend with `QiskitRuntimeService`.\n"
msgstr "Idagdag ang sumusunod na code sa iyong program file, na tumatawag sa iyong backend gamit ang `QiskitRuntimeService`.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
#| msgid "The following code assumes that you have already followed the process to save your credentials by using `QiskitRuntimeService.save_account`, and will load your default saved account unless you specify otherwise. See [Save your login credentials](/guides/save-credentials) and [Initialize your Qiskit Runtime service account](/guides/initialize-account) for more information.\n"
msgid "The following code assumes that you have already followed the process to save your credentials by using `QiskitRuntimeService.save_account`, and will load your default saved account unless you specify otherwise. See [Save your login credentials](/guides/save-credentials) and [Initialize your IBM Quantum Compute Service account](/guides/initialize-account) for more information.\n"
msgstr "Ipinapalagay ng sumusunod na code na naisagawa mo na ang proseso ng pag-save ng iyong credentials gamit ang `QiskitRuntimeService.save_account`, at maglo-load ng iyong default na naka-save na account maliban kung mag-specify ka ng iba. Tingnan ang [I-save ang iyong mga login credential](/guides/save-credentials) at [I-initialize ang iyong Qiskit Runtime service account](/guides/initialize-account) para sa karagdagang impormasyon.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Add code to transpile {#add-code-to-transpile}"
msgstr "Magdagdag ng code para mag-transpile {#add-code-to-transpile}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Finally, add the following code to your program file. This code runs `transpile_remote()` across all `circuits` passed in, and returns the `transpiled_circuits` as a result:\n"
msgstr "Sa wakas, idagdag ang sumusunod na code sa iyong program file. Ang code na ito ay nagpapatakbo ng `transpile_remote()` sa lahat ng `circuits` na ipinasa, at ibinabalik ang `transpiled_circuits` bilang resulta:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"upload-to-qiskit-serverless\"></span>\n"
msgstr "<span id=\"upload-to-qiskit-serverless\"></span>\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Authenticate to Qiskit Serverless {#authenticate-to-qiskit-serverless}"
msgstr "Mag-authenticate sa Qiskit Serverless {#authenticate-to-qiskit-serverless}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Use `qiskit-ibm-catalog` to authenticate to `QiskitServerless` with your API key (you can use your `QiskitRuntimeService` API key, or create a new API key on the [IBM Quantum Platform dashboard](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com)).\n"
msgstr "Gamitin ang `qiskit-ibm-catalog` para mag-authenticate sa `QiskitServerless` gamit ang iyong API key (maaari mong gamitin ang iyong `QiskitRuntimeService` API key, o gumawa ng bagong API key sa [IBM Quantum Platform dashboard](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com)).\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Run code to upload {#run-code-to-upload}"
msgstr "Patakbuhin ang code para mag-upload {#run-code-to-upload}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Run the following code to upload the program. Qiskit Serverless compresses the contents of `working_dir` (in this case, `source_files`) into a `tar`, which is uploaded and then cleaned up. The `entrypoint` identifies the main program executable for Qiskit Serverless to run.\n"
msgstr "Patakbuhin ang sumusunod na code para i-upload ang programa. Kino-compress ng Qiskit Serverless ang mga nilalaman ng `working_dir` (sa kasong ito, `source_files`) sa isang `tar`, na ini-upload at nilinis pagkatapos. Tinutukoy ng `entrypoint` ang pangunahing executable na programa para patakbuhin ng Qiskit Serverless.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Verify upload {#verify-upload}"
msgstr "I-verify ang upload {#verify-upload}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "To check if it successfully uploaded, use `serverless.list()`, as in the following code:\n"
msgstr "Para tingnan kung matagumpay na na-upload, gamitin ang `serverless.list()`, gaya ng sa sumusunod na code:\n"

